# STATIC_ROOT. `manage.py collectstatic` fills this; the production image
# (backend/Dockerfile) runs it at build time. Tracked as an empty
# directory on purpose: WhiteNoiseMiddleware warns "No directory at ..."
# on every start when STATIC_ROOT is missing, which is noise in CI and in
# any DEBUG=0 run that has not collected yet. Contents are gitignored.
#
# Note `collectstatic --clear` deletes this file along with everything
# else in here — `git checkout backend/staticfiles/.gitkeep` puts it back.
